<newsitem itemid="46295" id="root" date="1996-09-11" xml:lang="en">
<title>SINGAPORE: CWT first half net profit up 20 pct.</title>
<headline>CWT first half net profit up 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30 1996</p>
<p>		  (in millions of S$ unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    4.06	vs	3.38</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	2.71	vs	2.25</p>
<p>    Turnover		     55.99	vs     36.40</p>
<p>    Interest on borrowing     0.53	vs	0.52</p>
<p>    Interest income	     1.00	vs	0.19</p>
<p>    Associates		   (0.10)     vs	0.19</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		6.47	vs	4.80</p>
<p>    Tax			     1.93	vs	1.08</p>
<p>    Minorities		   (0.47)     vs     (0.34)</p>
<p>Note - CWT Distribution Ltd said the share of results of associated firms and joint ventures was depressed by start-up losses at its new shipping venture.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
